    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d96-a1">

                <pb facs="0213" n="107" xml:id="pg107"/>

                <head>[Inclosure—Translation.]</head>
                <p>Ismael Montes, Constitutional President of the Republic of Bolivia.</p>
                <p>Whereas the National Congress has sanctioned the following law:</p>
                <p>The National Congress decrees:</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Article</hi> 1. Declaring the necessity of the reform
                    of Article II of the Political Constitution of the State, consequently the
                    constitutional law is sanctioned as follows:</p>
                <p>“The State recognizes and sustains the Catholic, Roman Catholic religion,
                    permitting the public exercise of every other religious worship.”</p>
                <p>To be communicated to the Executive for the consequent constitutional
                    purposes.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">Hall of Sessions of the Honorable Congress,
                            <placeName>La Paz</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-09-24">August 24, 1906</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/> (Signed) <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Valentin
                        Abecia.</hi></signed><lb/>(Signed) <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Isaac
                            Aranibar.</hi></signed><lb/>(Signed) <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >José Carrasco</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of the
                            Senate</hi></signed>.<lb/>(Signed) <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Casto Rios.</hi></signed><lb/>(Signed) <signed><hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">Aurelio Gamarra. G.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Wherefore it is promulgated as a law of the Republic.</p>
                    <closer>
                        <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><placeName type="venue">Palace
                                    of the Government</placeName> in <placeName type="city">La
                                    Paz</placeName></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                                when="1906-08-27">August 27, 1906</date>.</dateline><lb/>(Signed)
                                <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ismael
                        Montes.</hi></signed><lb/>(Signed) <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Anibal Capriles</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Minister of
                                Government and Public Works.</hi></signed></closer>
                </postscript>
            </div>
